  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tunisia - Communications for policy reforms</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Development Objective is to contribute to public understanding of economic issues in Tunisia. This will be achieved through the production and dissemination of a series of media products that aim to educate, inform, and provoke public debate over the key economic issues facing the country.</narrative>
  </description>
